s=f.m4("1. Digital Product Delivery","BillSprout is a cloud-based software solution and license management system:\n\n\u2022 Instant Access: Upon successful payment, your license key is generated immediately\n\u2022 Digital Download: Software can be downloaded from your account dashboard\n\u2022 No Physical Shipping: There are no physical products to ship\n\u2022 Email Delivery: License key and download links sent to your registered email\n\u2022 Global Availability: Accessible worldwide with an internet connection")
r=f.m4("2. Software Delivery Process","After purchase, you will receive:\n\n1. Order Confirmation: Immediate email with order details\n2. License Key: Unique activation code for your subscription\n3. Download Links: Access to the latest software version\n4. Installation Guide: Step-by-step setup instructions\n5. Support Resources: Documentation and video tutorials\n\nDelivery Time: Instant (within seconds of payment confirmation)")
q=f.m4("3. Access to Your Account","You can access your BillSprout account and software:\n\n\u2022 Online Portal: Log in at any time from any device\n\u2022 Desktop Application: Download and install on Windows, Mac, or Linux\n\u2022 Mobile Access: Available on Android and iOS devices\n\u2022 Multi-Device: Use on multiple devices as per your subscription plan\n\u2022 Cloud Sync: Data synchronized across all your devices")
p=f.m4("4. License Key Issues",'If you experience issues with your license key:\n\n\u2022 Not Received: Check spam/junk folder first\n\u2022 Lost Key: Retrieve from your account dashboard under "My License"\n\u2022 Invalid Key: Contact support with your order ID\n\u2022 Activation Problems: Our support team will assist within 24 hours\n\u2022 Multiple Devices: Each plan has a specific device limit')
o=f.m4("5. Plan Exchange/Upgrade","You can exchange or upgrade your subscription plan:\n\n\u2022 Upgrade Anytime: Switch to a higher plan immediately\n\u2022 Downgrade: Change to a lower plan at the end of current billing cycle\n\u2022 Feature Access: Upgraded features available instantly\n\u2022 Pro-rated Billing: Pay only the difference when upgrading\n\u2022 No Exchange Fee: Plan changes are free of charge")
n=f.m4("6. Version Updates","Software updates are delivered automatically:\n\n\u2022 Free Updates: All bug fixes and minor updates included\n\u2022 Major Versions: Included in active subscription\n\u2022 Auto-Update: Optional automatic update installation\n\u2022 Manual Download: Available from your account dashboard\n\u2022 Beta Access: Professional and Enterprise plans get early access")
m=f.m4("7. Data Migration","For customers switching from other systems:\n\n\u2022 Free Data Import: Assistance with importing your existing data\n\u2022 Supported Formats: CSV, Excel, XML, and custom formats\n\u2022 Migration Support: Professional and Enterprise plans include migration assistance\n\u2022 Training Included: Get trained on using BillSprout effectively\n\u2022 No Data Loss: We ensure complete and accurate data transfer")
l=f.m4("8. Hardware Requirements","Minimum system requirements:\n\n\u2022 Operating System: Windows 10+, macOS 10.14+, Linux (Ubuntu 18.04+)\n\u2022 Processor: Intel Core i3 or equivalent\n\u2022 RAM: 4GB minimum, 8GB recommended\n\u2022 Storage: 500MB free space\n\u2022 Internet: Broadband connection for cloud sync\n\u2022 Browser: Chrome 90+, Firefox 88+, Safari 14+, Edge 90+")
k=f.m4("9. Technical Support","Comprehensive support included:\n\n\u2022 Email Support: Available for all plans\n\u2022 Priority Support: Professional and Enterprise plans\n\u2022 Phone/WhatsApp: Enterprise plan customers\n\u2022 Response Time: Within 24 hours (1 hour for Enterprise)\n\u2022 Knowledge Base: Extensive self-help documentation\n\u2022 Video Tutorials: Step-by-step guides")
j=f.m4("10. Subscription Transfers","Transferring your subscription:\n\n\u2022 Account Transfer: Contact support to transfer ownership\n\u2022 Business Sale: Subscription can be transferred to new owner\n\u2022 Name Change: Update account details anytime\n\u2022 Email Change: Primary email can be updated\n\u2022 Verification Required: Identity verification for security")
i=f.m4("11. Lost Access Recovery",'If you lose access to your account:\n\n\u2022 Password Reset: Use "Forgot Password" feature\n\u2022 Email Recovery: Sent to registered email\n\u2022 Account Lockout: Contact support for assistance\n\u2022 Backup Codes: Save backup codes for emergency access\n\u2022 Two-Factor Auth: Can be reset by support team')
h=f.m4("12. Contact for Delivery Issues","For any delivery or access issues:\n\nEmail: Support@billsprout.online\nTechnical Support: info@lifesproutcare.com\nWhatsApp: +44 7747 571513\n\nInclude your order ID and account email for faster resolution.")
